{"type":"text","id":"sec_text","x":1126,"y":712,"width":322,"height":146,"text":"Spring Security 只守 Actuator\n────────────────\n① actuator @Order(1)\n   hasRole(ENDPOINT_ADMIN)+Basic\n② default @Order(2)\n   permitAll · STATELESS\nBCryptPasswordEncoder 校验密码","originalText":"Spring Security 只守 Actuator\n────────────────\n① actuator @Order(1)\n   hasRole(ENDPOINT_ADMIN)+Basic\n② default @Order(2)\n   permitAll · STATELESS\nBCryptPasswordEncoder 校验密码","fontSize":13,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","strokeColor":"#1e40af","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":1331,"version":1,"versionNonce":1331,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":null,"link":null,"locked":false,"containerId":null,"lineHeight":1.35}
